{"id":"vod_sn_56300","vodId":"56300","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"反叛的鲁路修","name_cn":"反叛的鲁路修","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20231127-1/4f61889c5d69657c79fb35148b1e951e.jpg"},"summary":"鲁路修本是帝国的王子，在母后遇害后，和失明的妹妹一起被流放到11区（原日本国）作为人质。在那里他们结识了日本王子朱雀，三人共同度过一段美好的童年时光。帝国最终全面攻陷了11区，鲁路修和妹妹的安宁生活再次被剥夺，朱雀和他们也分散了。\r\n　　鲁路修和妹妹隐瞒身份，过着看似平凡的学生生活。然而鲁路修心中对于帝国的仇恨却未停止。他希望摧毁帝国，为妹妹营造一个可以快乐生活的世界。这一切随着神秘少女C.C的出现变得不再遥不可及。\r\n　　此时朱雀也再次出现在他们的生活中，然而残酷的现实让童年的挚友难以重温童年往事。这里没有正义和邪恶，黑暗与光明，有的仅仅是艰难的抉择和难以预料的明天。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-11-27 17:59:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/iT49qE4D6n2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/BrEggjVFvm2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/FWAjkHtPW72/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/FQTuPYcKxp2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/s5iqWiTVb32/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/8RN2uCd3612/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/2D5Ywdp2LZ2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/024G1sJF6E2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/ruAhJHLyUK2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/ZaCAdJ46be2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/wymzzKfN3X2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/u3rwFtAnSx2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/9D7XJTGE2T2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/26/B6cfpAf3Yq2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name"